        <li>Use Case Diagram</li>
        <li>Entity Relationship Diagram</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Appendix C: To Be Determined List</h2>
    <p>
        Future improvements may include integration with public food databases such as Open Food Facts,
        extended recommendation algorithms and support for additional geographical regions.
    </p>
</section>

